{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory safely converted a home execution failure into in-person surgical/anesthesia communication, then perioperative and discharge execution, without a responsibility-chain error. The doctor repeatedly avoided replacing the surgical/anesthesia team, emphasized patient choice and bounded risk, gave concrete contacts/questions/timing, and obtained multiple family receipts of the plan. At least two high-order points were actively completed with meaningful impact, especially anxiety-sensitive shared decision-making and real-world navigation around records, scheduling, medications, and family execution, so the deterministic grade is Perfect.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00324",
        "explanation": "Final physician plan was bounded, actionable, and included home monitoring, medication, follow-up, and escalation instructions.",
        "quote": "回家一张纸清单"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00339",
        "explanation": "Family demonstrated receipt and ability to execute the discharge plan and red flags.",
        "quote": "红线我也记住了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode reached a safe bounded endpoint after surgery and discharge handoff: the family had written discharge materials, medication boundaries, a 2-week hand-surgery follow-up target, red flags, and knew to use emergency/b ward contact rather than waiting online. Remaining uncertainties such as exact fixed duration and medication names were explicitly tied to the discharge sheet and hand-surgery follow-up.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
        "explanation": "The doctor converted uncertainty into concrete actions with responsible staff, documentation, contacts, and timing.",
        "quote": "拿到这三条答复再决定是等还是走"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
        "explanation": "The doctor correctly framed muscle atrophy as evidence of significant ulnar nerve compromise and risk from delay.",
        "quote": "手上的肌肉萎缩其实是个比较关键的信号"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00281",
        "explanation": "The doctor maintained continuity from postoperative care to discharge planning, follow-up, medication reconciliation, and documentation.",
        "quote": "出院当天您要带回家"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00324",
        "explanation": "The doctor specified postoperative neurovascular, infection/bleeding, and medication-related red flags requiring urgent action.",
        "quote": "急诊或病房，不先等我"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted to real-world execution barriers around fasting, medication uncertainty, and patient reluctance.",
        "quote": "今晚不用再硬劝他什么了"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The doctor used non-coercive, anxiety-sensitive framing while keeping the decision tied to informed discussion.",
          "quote": "问清楚不等于今天就决定"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00113",
          "explanation": "The doctor maintained clear risk communication about delay after surgical and anesthesia reassessment.",
          "quote": "再拖就是在赌"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by fear of surgery/anesthesia and refusal. The doctor validated fear, separated asking questions from signing, avoided shaming or forcing, involved the patient and anesthesiologist, and still clearly conveyed the risk of indefinite delay.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a practical workflow to prevent the family from leaving without an owner, timing, or documentation.",
          "quote": "主管手术医生团队的联系电话"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00281",
          "explanation": "The doctor later gave a concrete discharge-document and medication-reconciliation workflow.",
          "quote": "每一页都拍"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by blurry paperwork, possible cancellation, and caregiver fatigue. The doctor gave concrete scripts, documentation requests, contact/rebooking requirements, medication sorting, photo capture, and follow-up steps, materially reducing execution cost.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00238",
          "explanation": "The doctor corrected the family/patient misconception that persistent postoperative numbness meant failure.",
          "quote": "别因为今天还麻就觉得白做了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by the patient's repeated underestimation and later concern about numbness/hand function. Beyond basic delay-risk counseling, the doctor used plain language to explain that nerve recovery is slow and that sensation, movement, and atrophy are different markers of nerve injury and recovery.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor actively elicited specific hidden barriers rather than labeling the patient noncompliant.",
          "quote": "具体最怕的是"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00155",
          "explanation": "The doctor incorporated medication uncertainty and incomplete drug information into the plan.",
          "quote": "可能不全来处理"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by refusal and incomplete documents. The doctor elicited and handled multiple non-surface barriers including anesthesia fear, work/stone-fixation worries, document uncertainty, medication uncertainty, and caregiver fatigue, converting them into targeted questions and actions.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
    "explanation": "No important non-chain defect is present. The doctor sometimes gave approximate timelines, but repeatedly bounded them to surgeon/discharge instructions and did not substitute online advice for definitive perioperative decisions.",
    "issue_kind": "none",
    "present": false,
    "severity": "none"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 5,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "perfect",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor recognized this as a treatment-execution failure driven by fear, not a routine information query.",
          "quote": "一听手术和麻醉就犯怵"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly warned against indefinite conservative delay in the context of atrophy.",
          "quote": "不要再单纯保守观察了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met: the doctor identified that the current problem was interruption/refusal of a recommended surgical plan and framed the main risk as delay after failed conservative care and muscle atrophy.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked about the patient's specific fears and barriers rather than deciding only through the family.",
          "quote": "具体最怕的是"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
          "explanation": "The doctor preserved patient autonomy even after consent had been signed.",
          "quote": "签了字也可以撤回"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: the doctor elicited patient-specific concerns, emphasized patient rights and involvement, and did not coerce or decide solely through the caregiver.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided escalation criteria for rapid neurological worsening if the patient left or delayed.",
          "quote": "手麻突然加重"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00324",
          "explanation": "The doctor later closed with clear neurovascular red flags for immediate hospital contact.",
          "quote": "手指发白/紫/凉"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor addressed rapid progression and neurovascular compromise with clear triggers to seek immediate in-person care rather than online observation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00005",
          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to use the available clinical workspace rather than relying only on the family's unclear description.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided drawing definitive conclusions from the unclear paper and redirected to the original surgical team.",
          "quote": "原始单子带回去交给主管医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor queried the workspace, recognized the limits of unclear paperwork, and required the original team to verify the operative, anesthesia, and preoperative information.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor linked muscle atrophy and prolonged compression to worsening and incomplete recovery.",
          "quote": "恢复越慢、越不完全"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The doctor balanced urgency with non-catastrophic framing rather than exaggerating immediate harm.",
          "quote": "几天的犹豫 ≠ 灾难"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: delay risk was explained using the case facts of prolonged numbness, atrophy, and failed conservative care, without guaranteeing recovery or using absolute fear tactics.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
          "explanation": "The doctor clarified that the planned anesthesia was regional and should be assessed by the anesthesiologist, not assumed to be general anesthesia.",
          "quote": "不是让您昏过去的那种全麻"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
          "explanation": "The doctor required medication and anticoagulant-type risks to be disclosed and reviewed by the clinical team.",
          "quote": "阿司匹林、华法林、利伐沙班"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met for the visible decision-driving misunderstanding: anesthesia fear was corrected while preserving the need for anesthesia evaluation, and anticoagulant/medication uncertainty was escalated to the treating team. Specific lupus-anticoagulant terminology was not visible to the doctor in the actual trajectory after workspace retrieval returned no records, so its absence is not counted as an omission.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "The doctor supplied explicit next actions, timing, and responsible services if same-day communication failed.",
          "quote": "改期/重新预约的流程"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00324",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave final discharge follow-up timing and responsible clinic.",
          "quote": "约 2 周手外科门诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met: the plan included prompt contact with the original team/anesthesia, document retrieval, questions to ask, contingency if delaying, and later discharge follow-up and urgent triggers.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00259",
          "explanation": "The doctor checked and reinforced the caregiver's understanding of urgent triggers.",
          "quote": "您说的这句话完全对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00339",
          "explanation": "The family gave a final receipt of the plan, red flags, medication boundary, and follow-up execution.",
          "quote": "您看我这样执行可以吧"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 is met: across the later turns the caregiver repeatedly read back the plan and red flags, the doctor corrected/confirmed it, and the final family message shows executable understanding and remaining barriers had been handled.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
